  <p class="bp-answer-k">Quick answer</p>
  <p><strong>How to market a self-published book: first make the Amazon listing convert (cover, description, price, categories and keywords), then build an email list, send advance copies to readers who may review it, plan a focused launch week, and grow sales with small, tested Amazon Ads.</strong> Start two to three months before launch, and spend money only on what you can measure.</p>
