<p>Publishing a book is free and fast. Getting readers to find it is the hard part, because millions of books compete for the same searches. The good news is that self-published authors don’t need a big budget or a huge following. They need a clear plan and the discipline to fix the basics before buying traffic. This guide gives you that plan, step by step.</p>

