    <li>Free review copies are allowed, but you <strong>can’t require a review</strong> in return.</li>
    <li>Amazon Ads start from <strong>$1 a day</strong>; test small and keep only what sells.</li>
    <li>Marketing doesn’t stop after launch. <strong>Your next book</strong> is your best marketing.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

